Package: dsf
Type: Package
Title: Destination Selection Functions for Redistribution Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Chris", "Sutherland", email = "chrissuthy@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits destination selection functions (DSFs), a competing-hazards
    model for redistribution data in which an individual's origin, its
    destination, and the full set of candidate destinations are known.
    Covariates enter the redistribution scale (individual level) and the
    destination attractiveness (destination level). Includes a simulator
    that generates a landscape, trap array, and redistribution events.
